                    <div class="sec-parts-inner">
                        <p><b>What we do</b></p>
                        <p>On our Platform, Barrway connects you with various Vendors so you can book a range of services. When you make a reservation for services through our Vendors, Barrway serves as an intermediary to assist with your booking on behalf of the Vendor.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sec-parts-inner">
