                            <p>Payments for services booked via the Platform are processed through the Platform's payment system. The Platform deducts a Service Charge from payments made by Customers before remitting the balance to the Vendor. Payments to Vendors are distributed on a monthly or quarterly basis as agreed during the subscription process. It is important to note that Barrway does not handle the refund process between Vendors and Customers. Vendors are responsible for managing refunds directly with Customers according to their own policies and the terms agreed at the time of booking.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
